WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:03.120
An agent is about to spend your customer's budget.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.720
Unprice reserves sixty cents before the provider call.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.640
The call runs inside that reservation.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.340
It uses forty cents.

00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:18.500
Twenty cents become available again.

00:00:22.065 --> 00:00:24.640
The next request needs eighty cents.

00:00:24.704 --> 00:00:26.160
Only sixty remain.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.240
It stops before the provider call.

00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:32.300
Authorize agent spend before the provider call.

00:00:32.393 --> 00:00:33.140
Unprice.
